---
---
<div class="section">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="text">
      <h3>¿Tenés alguna duda?</h3>
      <p>Escribime por email. También estoy disponible para clases privadas.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="mailto:albertoalonsoesp@gmail.com" class="email-link">
      Contactar por email
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .section {
    background: var(--color-ink);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .text h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .text p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #aaa;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .email-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .email-link::after {
    content: '→';
    color: var(--color-crimson);
  }

  .email-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-crimson);
    background: #1f1515;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
